# Trend — Layout A: area chart

Wide tile (6x3). Continuous shape over the window; weekends visible;
total + window in header. For "is activity rising or dying".

```
+------------------------------------------------------+
| Event volume          312 events . last 30d . daily  |
+------------------------------------------------------+
| 24|                                  x               |
|   |                    x.          .x x.             |
| 16|        .x.       .x  x.   .x..x    x             |
|   |      .x   x..x..x      x.x                       |
|  8|  x..x                                            |
|   |_x________________________________________________|
|    may 13        may 23         jun 2         jun 12 |
+------------------------------------------------------+
```

Config: bucket=day|week, since=7d|30d|90d, eventTypes[] filter
(created/updated/...); conceptId scopes to one concept.
